		<li>Rainier—Cleared space in shade of cliff, by pools. Rainiers flavored to be cleaning pools?</li>
		<li>Scavenger—Barely organized chaos in 'landing zone' of colony home. Scavengers sorting hauls.</li>
		<li>Salvager—Safehouse carved halfway up cliff-face. Salvagers lounging in safe-house, coming and going.</li>
		<li>Builder—Carved stone and lumber, some in progress, short distance from storage cavern. Builders going over plans or directing each other in shaping wood / stone.</li>
		<li>Soldier—Stone dummies reinforced, in various shapes; water and food available under shaded area, far from resting spaces. Soldiers training, planning routes, moving between shifts.</li>
		<li></li>
	</ul> */
<</nobr>>